# sym4mm, drawing with p4mm symmetry in a 512 by 512 window: a left drag draws (mirrored into the eight copies), a middle drag rubber-bands
# a straight line drawn on its release, a right drag erases; f lifts the restriction to the generating region and a drag far from it draws;
# s writes the snapshot sym000.gif (part of the answer), c clears, one more point, and q ends the program by itself
drag 1 150 60 230 120
wait
drag 2 60 20 220 40
wait
drag 3 150 60 170 75
wait
move 256 256
key f
drag 1 400 300 460 420
wait
move 256 256
key s
wait
key c
wait
move 300 100
press 1
release 1
wait
move 256 256
key q
